<title>USA: Centennial Tech indicated at 4 to 4-1/2.</title>
<headline>Centennial Tech indicated at 4 to 4-1/2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange on Tuesday said shares of Centennial Technologies Inc were indicated to open at between four and 4-1/2, down from their last trade of 16-1/2.</p>
<p>The shares have been halted since February 11, when the company announced that its previous financial results had included material misstatements.</p>
<p>Early Tuesday, the company said it would restate its earnings, resulting in losses for fiscal 1996 and the first two quarters of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>The NYSE said earlier it would apply to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to delist the shares.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
